  "plain": "Lee Harvey Oswald, the man accused of killing President John F. Kennedy in Dallas in 1963, is said to have tried to place a telephone call to Nags Head, a town in North Carolina, asking the operator for the call. Michels tells this himself, without naming a source, in an episode about Kennedy and UFOs with the lawyer Danny Sheehan. The point of telling it is that the call hints Oswald had connections he was trying to reach."
